{"id":"n87822-1-10","stage":4,"title":"휴직 · 暂时停职","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87822-1-10-1","ko":"유민이가 휴직을 했다면서?","zh":"听说裕敏暂时停职休假了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이가","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"유민이가","audio":"/audio/9f714db1c17c8ecf0221.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"휴직을","meaning":"暂时停职","explanation":"휴직：暂时停职；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"휴직","audio":"/audio/a60257d4d13367a5c26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87822","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했다면서?","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a60257d4d13367a5","term":"휴직","zh":"暂时停职","audio":"/audio/a60257d4d13367a5c26e.mp3","entryId":"87822","definition":"一定期间内停止所担任的工作。","pronunciation":["휴직"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3d0487f00d768d1f8d6b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87822-1-10-2","ko":"응, 부모님께서 많이 편찮으시다고 들었어.","zh":"嗯，听说她父母病得很重。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부모님께서","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모님：父母；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。","readings":[{"term":"부모님","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62272","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"en